# Compiled programs. Ctrl+Shift+B and the build-and-run task name them *.exe,
# so they are easy to spot and never get committed by accident. (The C/C++
# extension's play button uses its own settings and names the program with no
# extension at all -- that one still has to be deleted by hand.)
*.exe
*.out
*.o
a.out

# Editor / OS noise
.DS_Store
*.swp
